# Vanishing Act's available arm, the zoning flag alone (task 7 review of the mutants): Delivering the Goods' 41 sets
# the flag and a Stage one minute on; after a JST day the Stage is past but the flag still holds, so Qutiba and
# Ulamaal answer 52 and 53; after a zone-out and back the same talks answer 42.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Qutiba/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Ulamaal/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=2.897,0,-10.781 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.DeliveringTheGoods accepted
charvar Quest[6][61]Prog 1
login
trigger Fochacha                        # 41
finish                                  # completed; Stage now + 60; needToZone
wait jst=1                              # past the Stage
trigger Qutiba                          # the flag holds: 52
finish
trigger Ulamaal                         # the flag holds: 53
finish
warp -64,-7,38 AlZahbi                  # the zoning flag cleared
warp 92.341,-6.5,-127.5 AhtUrhganWhitegate
trigger Qutiba                          # 42
finish option=1
trigger Ulamaal                         # 42
finish option=1
